, pose and small clothing details may vary; the scene is regenerated. 640 pixel budget, 25 steps.\n\nBuilt with Qwen. Existing Noct Q V4 weights and core ComfyUI nodes. Sources, validation and license: doc/comfyui.md, NoctQ-LICENSE.txt and NoctQ-NOTICE.txt.\n\nPose control works through composition. The model can keep the pose photo's background or outfit despite the instructions; use All with clear face and garment references for better appearance control."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## All: upload photos and Run\n\n1. Press **Upload** on each labeled photo node.\n2. Adjust the green instructions if needed, then press **Run**.\n3. The result is saved under `NoctQ_Edit/All`.\n\n**The pose photo sets the body pose and framing.** The main photo guides the scene and shoes; the face and garment photos supply appearance.\n\n`<image1>` = pose, `<image2>` = base, `<image3>` = face, `<image4>` = clothing.\n\nFor only a face/head or garment change, use the **Face** or **Clothing** workflow; those keep the main photo's framing. Clear faces, visible limbs and clear garment photos help.\n\nThis is generative editing. Identity, pose and small clothing details may vary; the scene is regenerated. 640 pixel budget, 25 steps.\n\nBuilt with Qwen. Existing Noct Q V4 weights and core ComfyUI nodes. Sources, validation and license: doc/comfyui.md, NoctQ-LICENSE.txt and NoctQ-NOTICE.txt.\n\nPose control works through composition. The model can keep the pose photo's background or outfit despite the instructions; use All with clear face and garment references for better appearance control."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[7,1,0,5,0,"MODEL"],[8,5,0,6,0,"MODEL"],[9,4,0,6,1,"CONDITIONING"],[10,4,1,6,2,"CONDITIONING"],[11,4,2,6,3,"LATENT"],[12,6,0,7,0,"LATENT"],[13,3,0,7,1,"VAE"],[14,7,0,8,0,"IMAGE"],[15,10,0,14,0,"IMAGE"],[16,7,0,14,1,"IMAGE"],[1,2,0,4,0,"CLIP"],[3,12,0,4,1,"IMAGE"],[4,10,0,4,2,"IMAGE"],[5,11,0,4,3,"IMAGE"],[6,13,0,4,4,"IMAGE"],[2,3,0,4,6,"VAE"]],"groups":[